er <\/em><em><strong>keeps my floor spotless without me doing anything.<\/strong><\/em><em> I run it daily before dinner time<\/em><\/p>","author":"<em><strong>Tanmay Jain, Pune<\/strong><\/em>"}}},"block_order":["column_PfJECp","column_aGVzRR","column_3aeFDV","column_39Ukef"],"name":"Testimonials","settings":{"display_id":false,"visibility":"always-display","title":"💬 What Customers Are Saying","title_highlight_color":"#6d388b","heading_size":"h1","text":"","color_scheme":"background-1","image_width":"full","image_ratio":"square","column_alignment":"center","show_stars":true,"stars_color":"#ffd700","show_quotes":true,"quotes_color_scheme":"accent-2","cards_color_scheme":"bg-overlay","type":"loop","autoplay":true,"autoplay_speed":5,"arrows_color_scheme":"inverse","transparent_arrows":true,"dots_color_scheme":"inverse","desktop_full_page":false,"columns_desktop":3,"slider_desktop":true,"per_move_desktop":1,"desktop_spacing":40,"desktop_side_padding":0,"desktop_padding_calc":true,"desktop_adaptive_height":true,"desktop_dots_position":"under","desktop_arrows_position":"sides","slider_mobile":true,"enable_mobile_preview":false,"mobile_adaptive_height":true,"mobile_dots_position":"under","mobile_arrows_position":"hidden","padding_top":36,"padding_bottom":36,"custom_colors_background":"#ffffff","custom_gradient_background":"","custom_colors_text":"#2e2a39","custom_cards_colors_background":"#f3f3f3","custom_cards_gradient_background":"","custom_cards_colors_text":"#2e2a39"}},"collapsible_content_EUY8hK":{"type":"collapsible-content","blocks":{"collapsible_row_fMpgCN":{"type":"collapsible_row","settings":{"heading":"Can it mop and vacuum together?","icon":"quiz","filled_icon":false,"row_content":"<p>Yes! It has a dual-action system – it vacuums dust and debris while mopping with a microfiber pad for a complete clean.<\/p>","page":""}},"collapsible_row_q9VBEc":{"type":"collapsible_row","settings":{"heading":"Is it safe for all types of flooring?","icon":"quiz","filled_icon":false,"row_content":"<p>100%. It's designed for use on tiles, marble, hardwood, laminate, and vinyl. Safe and gentle on all flat surfaces.<\/p>","page":""}},"collapsible_row_QMKegb":{"type":"collapsible_row","settings":{"heading":"How long does the battery last?","icon":"quiz","filled_icon":false,"row_content":"<p>On a full charge, it can clean up to <strong>120 minutes continuously<\/strong> – covering up to 2000 sq. ft.<\/p>","page":""}},"collapsible_row_hYtPED":{"type":"collapsible_row","settings":{"heading":"Will it fall off stairs or bump into furniture?","icon":"quiz","filled_icon":false,"row_content":"<p>No! It has <strong>anti-drop and anti-collision sensors<\/strong> that prevent falls and help it navigate smoothly around furniture and edges.<\/p>","page":""}},"collapsible_row_bbh47c":{"type":"collapsible_row","settings":{"heading":"Can it clean under beds or sofas?","icon":"quiz","filled_icon":false,"row_content":"<p>Yes. Its <strong>slim, low-profile design<\/strong> allows it to glide under furniture and reach areas you can’t usually access.<\/p>","page":""}},"collapsible_row_JkkWBJ":{"type":"collapsible_row","settings":{"heading":"Is it noisy?","icon":"quiz","filled_icon":false,"row_content":"<p>Not at all. It runs at a quiet volume – less than 55 dB. You can work, relax, or sleep while it cleans.<\/p>","page":""}},"collapsible_row_WBHiY3":{"type":"collapsible_row","settings":{"heading":"Is Cash on Delivery (COD) available?","icon":"quiz","filled_icon":false,"row_content":"<p>Yes, we provide the <strong>COD option across India<\/strong> along with fast delivery. You can also choose prepaid options for quicker dispatch.<\/p>","page":""}}},"block_order":["collapsible_row_fMpgCN","collapsible_row_q9VBEc","collapsible_row_QMKegb","collapsible_row_hYtPED","collapsible_row_bbh47c","collapsible_row_JkkWBJ","collapsible_row_WBHiY3"],"custom_css":[".collapsible-content-wrapper-narrow {max-width: 100.4rem;}"],"settings":{"display_id":false,"visibility":"always-di